{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22156","headline":"晚春酤酒 · 白居易","name":"晚春酤酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百花落如雪，两鬓垂作丝。\n春去有来日，我老无少时。\n人生待富贵，爲乐常苦迟。\n不如贫贱日，随分开愁眉。\n卖我所乘马，典我旧朝衣。\n尽将酤酒饮，酩酊步行归。\n名姓日隐晦，形骸日变衰。\n醉卧黄公肆，人知我是谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}